@shipmentKeyId = a6f3c0e0-0001-4000-8000-000000000002

### Event read:key — provider emits a key-only message; the consumer bridge
### calls executeEvent → one-shot OData read → MAP → WRITE.
### Allow ~1s for file-based messaging to deliver before querying local rows.
POST http://localhost:4455/odata/v4/logistics/emitShipmentKeyTest
Content-Type: application/json

{"ID": "{{shipmentKeyId}}"}

###
GET http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments?$filter=id eq {{shipmentKeyId}}

### Watermark unchanged — event micro-runs must not advance batch lastSync.
GET http://localhost:4107/pipeline/Pipelines?$filter=name eq 'Shipments'&$select=name,lastSync

### Event runs in history (trigger = event)
GET http://localhost:4107/pipeline/PipelineRuns?$filter=name eq 'Shipments' and trigger eq 'event'&$orderby=startTime desc&$top=5

### Delete local row, then re-emit key — read:key recreates from remote.
DELETE http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments(id={{shipmentKeyId}})

POST http://localhost:4455/odata/v4/logistics/emitShipmentKeyTest
Content-Type: application/json

{"ID": "{{shipmentKeyId}}"}

###
GET http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments?$filter=id eq {{shipmentKeyId}}
